Error [E0113]: This value is String (text), but `bad` returns Int
  --> tests/ui/module_inline_type_error.jet:2:30
    |
  2 |     fn bad() -> Int { return "not a number" }
    |                              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `bad` declares Int as its result, so the value it hands back must be Int
 Fix: Hand back a Int value: convert this value to Int, or return the value you meant
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0113
